eNH3-Bench

eNH3-Bench is a separate project for source-grounded electrochemical ammonia
synthesis evidence extraction and reliability validation.

OpenScholar may be used as an external conceptual or code reference for
pipeline organization ideas such as unified CLI entrypoints, retrieval,
feedback, and attribution checking. eNH3-Bench does not vendor OpenScholar and
does not imply endorsement by OpenScholar authors or Apache.

Any copied or modified OpenScholar-derived files must be clearly marked in the
file, preserve required license and attribution notices, and be recorded in
docs/code_reuse_log.md before release.
